<title>NETHERLANDS: Aegon Q4 net profit NLG 468 million.</title>
<headline>Aegon Q4 net profit NLG 468 million.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth quarter 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				  468     vs   380</p>
<p>    Net profit per share (guilders)	1.76   vs   1.44</p>
<p>    Total revenues (billions)		6.28   vs   5.45</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected insurer Aegon NV to report a fourth quarter net profit of 435 to 467 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
